Package: sage
Type: Package
Title: Small-Area Global Elections Archive: Data Retrieval Helpers
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Noah", "Dasanaike", email = "noahdasanaike@g.harvard.edu", role = c("aut", "cre")))
Description: Provides convenience functions to download and subset slices of
    the Small-Area Global Elections (SAGE) archive without having to read
    monolithic country-level RDS files. Pulls partitioned Parquet from a
    public bucket (default: SAGE_BUCKET environment variable or the
    archive URL given in the manuscript) and exposes a single
    sage_load(country, years, columns) function that returns a tibble.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
